{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50166","headline":"答徐四萧关别醉後见投 · 胡皓","name":"答徐四萧关别醉後见投","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧关城南陇入云，萧关城北海生荒[一]。\n（蒋云：「荒」即「尘」字草书之误。\n）咄嗟塞外同爲客，满酌杯中一送君。\n（[一]刘云：「『荒』字不叶韵，不知是何字误？\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}